!!! oculus/appearance/accessibility.mat
!!! Accessibility requirements and nonvisual state.
!!!
!!! Ensures the desktop meets minimum contrast ratios
!!! and can operate without a visual display.

book oculus.appearance.accessibility

read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! Contrast level for text readability.

public contrast-level begin choice
    when Normal
    when Enhanced
    when Maximum
end choice

!!! Accessibility configuration.

public accessibility-config begin record
    field contrast as contrast-level
    field reduce-motion as boolean
    field screen-reader-enabled as boolean
    field min-text-size as override long
end record
